# Whitelist approach: ignore everything, then re-include only what the image
# needs. This keeps the build context tiny (~the size of python/ + Builds/ +
# data/) no matter what else lives in the project root - Unity Library/ and
# Assets/, old results/, datasets, conda envs, etc. all stay out automatically.
*

!python
!Builds
!data
!entrypoint.sh

# Re-exclude noise inside the whitelisted directories.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.DS_Store
